UI Elements: Update buttons with modern styling (e.g., subtle rounded corners, crisp hover states, elegant drop shadows).

Visual Assets: Use high-quality, professional imagery or clean vector illustrations that match a cohesive color scheme.

Overall Vibe: Sleek, trustworthy, premium, and uncluttered